  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{着|き}る (wear/put on X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates resulting state. {着|き}て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is wearing' (not 'is putting on').\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦コート→コート：01358_kooto⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{着|き}る (put on/wear a coat)\n- {着|き}て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (is wearing - state)\n- ⟦{着|き}{替|か}える→着替える：04603_kigaeru⟧ (change clothes)\n- ⟦{着物|きもの}→着物：01309_kimono⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{着|き}る (wear kimono)\n\nCLOTHING VERBS:\n- {着|き}る: upper body/full body\n- ⟦はく→履く：00700_haku⟧: pants, shoes, skirts\n- ⟦かぶる→かぶる：00709_kaburu⟧: hats\n- ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: accessories\n\nOpposite: ⟦{脱|ぬ}ぐ→脱ぐ：00518_nugu⟧ (take off). Don't confuse with ⟦{切|き}る→切る：02693_kiru⟧ (to cut - godan).",
